  "description": "Spec element-focus: F labels the text blocks of fixture:article.html (element-hints); the label d focuses its second paragraph, outlined in the browser, with the ELEMENT badge and 'paragraph · 191 chars' in the status bar (element-focus); v selects the paragraph in copy mode (element-visual) and y copies it. Then F, la and y copy the code block, and pasting it into the page's text field gives its exact text without the line-number gutter: the page titles itself 'pasted code exact'. The status bar shows the fixture server's port, a few digits that vary between runs, well inside the 0.5 % screenshot tolerance.",
